# Where the contact form delivers to.
#
# Any endpoint that accepts a JSON POST works: Formspree, Formspark, a Google
# Apps Script web app, a Slack/Discord incoming webhook, or your own handler.
# Leave it unset in development — the form will report honestly that it isn't
# connected, and the page always shows the mailto: address as a fallback.
CONTACT_WEBHOOK_URL=
